WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,530
Do you have any hatred?

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:08,880
That senior brother Wang who used to have his nostrils turned upward

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,880
Don’t we have to be like us now?

4
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,880
There's a bucket hanging behind my butt

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,680
In the past, I relied on his comfort to manage things.

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,680
Riding on our heads to shit

7
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,680
Nowadays, things are changing

8
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,680
No matter how powerful you are, you still have to carry water obediently

9
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,860
No matter how depressed I am

10
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,540
Not you guys

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,540
Vengeance can stir the tongue

12
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:41,990
I take back everything that belongs to me

13
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:42,990
I want you

14
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:45,250
And these blind bastards

15
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,250
We will go together for your price
